          <p class="explorer__text">We evaluate internal network security and Active Directory environments for privilege escalation, weak authentication policies, credential exposure, Kerberos-related weaknesses and lateral movement opportunities. These assessments help organizations understand how an attacker with initial network access could compromise additional systems.</p>
        </article>
