<!-- PROCESS                                                              -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s6-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s6-title">Our Penetration Testing Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">Our penetration testing process helps businesses identify security weaknesses, understand potential risks and take the right steps to protect their digital assets. CipherTrivia follows a structured approach to assess your systems, explain the findings in simple terms and recommend practical improvements.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Understanding Your Requirements</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We understand your business needs and identify the websites, applications, networks or cloud systems that need testing. Our team defines the testing scope and objectives before the assessment begins.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Identifying Potential Weaknesses</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We examine your systems to identify security gaps, weak access controls and potential entry points that attackers could exploit. This helps us understand where your digital assets may be at risk.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Testing Security Risks</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We safely test identified weaknesses to understand how they could affect your systems and business operations. This helps determine which issues could lead to unauthorized access, data exposure or service disruption.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Evaluating Risk &amp; Impact</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We prioritize the identified issues based on their seriousness and potential impact on your business. This helps your team focus first on the most critical security risks.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Sharing Findings &amp; Recommendations</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We provide a clear penetration testing report explaining the identified weaknesses, their potential impact and the recommended steps to fix them. The report helps technical teams and business stakeholders understand what needs attention.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Retesting &amp; Verification</h3>
          <p class="step__text">After the recommended fixes are implemented, we can retest the affected systems, where included in the agreed scope, to check whether the identified issues have been resolved.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

