<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s7-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s7-title">What You Receive From Our Penetration Testing Services</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our penetration testing services provide clear reports and practical recommendations to help businesses understand security vulnerabilities and take corrective action. CipherTrivia delivers actionable findings for technical teams while giving management the insights needed to assess security risks, prioritize fixes and strengthen protection against cyberattacks.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="deliver">
      <div class="deliver__media rv">
        <img class="media-img" src="/assets/images/penetration-testing/report.webp" width="1200" height="1500" alt="Example penetration testing report with an attack path analysis and rated findings" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <ol class="deliver__list">
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("present") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Executive Summary</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">A clear overview of your security assessment highlighting the most important security risks, critical vulnerabilities and potential business impact. It helps management understand the current security posture and prioritize improvements without requiring deep technical knowledge.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("document") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Penetration Testing Report</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">A detailed report documenting identified and verified security vulnerabilities, their severity, supporting evidence and potential impact. The findings help technical teams understand where weaknesses exist and how they could affect applications, networks or business data.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("route") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Attack Path Analysis</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">A visual explanation of how multiple security weaknesses could be connected to create a potential attack path. This helps your team understand how attackers might gain unauthorized access, move between systems or reach sensitive information.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("wrench") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Vulnerability Remediation Guidance</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Practical recommendations for fixing identified vulnerabilities and improving existing security controls. Each finding includes prioritized corrective actions to help development and IT teams address security gaps efficiently.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("shield-check") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Retesting &amp; Closure Report</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">After fixes are implemented, we can retest identified vulnerabilities as agreed in the engagement scope. The closure report records the remediation status, highlights resolved issues and identifies any remaining findings that require attention.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

